Output screenshots/hooks.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 620
Set Height 230
Set Padding 24
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set TypingSpeed 35ms

Hide
Type "source screenshots/setup.bash && clear" Enter
Wait@60s /app>$/
Show

Type "cat ww.toml" Sleep 400ms Enter Sleep 1.5s
Type "cd $(ww acquire --purpose 'try the new api')" Sleep 400ms Enter Sleep 1s
Type "cat .env" Sleep 400ms Enter Sleep 5s
